CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/w com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/MovableUnit
	COMMENT Movable unit base (ground/sea/hover/air vehicles): extends OrderableUnit, overrides I()=true (can move), i()=false, Q()=false. Verified memberless besides the (boolean) ctor. Parent of land/ (LandUnit, HoverUnit) and air/ (AirUnit, AirShip, ...). [iOS-confirmed]
